<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-18T16:02:14.126Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 16:02:14 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian authorities arrested the suspect known as the &amp;quot;Butcher of Baniyas&amp;quot; for the 2013 coastal massacres and a separate suspect was abducted from Lebanon, while an attack on a martyrs’ cemetery in Aleppo sparked protests in Rojava. The Israeli Defense Forces permitted Lebanese and Syrian workers to enter a northern security zone to harvest olives, and a Daesh plot was foiled after a landmine blast killed a soldier. Pakistan and Syria are expanding military cooperation, and Turkey’s declared neutrality in the Ukraine war is being framed as beneficial for Syrian Kurds. The conflict produced 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPS2JjWFgtb3diSHFwYXZ4SnFpdGNndXlsYjJPeDRXSUpoZXI1TkktdTdYQW1DZnBjVWhzZnhMLWhnWXNRX19uYnBmalhyX25HSUd6Z0J2WWRnZFluUFptMWlzbV9odXFaTTVPOXFweE9hRDdoTmhFMkhMVHJnVy01djNOdktQWkZGZ0QxaEFFQ211UDB1VGlEQ3ZIZnJIQXN6OHZjaXNzSzJzUVIwVjRjT0R2T01vczhK?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQdnVjS2Z5NTMwMndLT1d3SXpnNmt2a2xnU21lWE8wQ0lQTTkyUUtKSXdZTkVDNlZFWHREaERBWFF0bkR4Ui0zM3FMc3VGZVB3aHI1LU5UTG5NZXIybjZfQ2xJcDZSMDRYbnBZRmJKRWJXcm5TR1k0SkplZlNXTkljZlpQclJHNjRuSm94S2ZUQVlQSnUwQzEzT0JZWjFrNVA2VGl0VA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQdi05allpRWo2Q2xOUmcyajlPY3hOT3F2N014aGpNQl9KTEhRSVl6b0pxU3pCdDQyTWZIY1M2dE1yMjY2cE5BazBSRHYzeURBQkdUdlRQMWlQdEhJdVlFeW54SnpRUUxaWkExTVJHSmprZDdtdU9PMlhlNVRhSlMzbU9FckVvOFdtU2txSlo5UWNhMUd0N0VoY08xU0FmTWEycjM5TDgwRUpQd3cwWHZ3?oc=5&quot;&gt;ANF English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxNYjVUQTEyR3E2NVZVZGpUenVOQm5PQjFTSnFDQ2ZqRzdtS05ub3EtMzkxX1FjdTZhbmNaVlRtT09wRXI1elJXN2pILU85VW